        "closed_at": null,
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "body": "Thanks for the great template. It is very useful and I'll definitely be using it for the next jam! I've integrated it with neovim & overseer (https://github.com/stevearc/overseer.nvim/tree/master) to automatically rebuild on file save and it works great for small projects. \r\n\r\nI think this should not exit 1 though. This is a successful hot reload and not a failure. (https://github.com/karl-zylinski/odin-raylib-hot-reload-game-template/blob/c0825bbe9e2580441e4d89323407f9245729c6d4/build_hot_reload.sh#L47). I noticed this because in my case this fires a failure notification in neovim because of the exit code. \r\n\r\nThere may be a reason for this that I do not understand, however. \r\n\r\n",
