        "body": "> However, I just have that simple ./build_hot_reload.sh && ./game_hotreload.bin line in my sublime project, in order to avoid yet another script.\r\n\r\nOh, I see. I didn't try to run it again like that. I just ran `./build_hot_reload.sh && ./game_hotreload.bin` in my terminal once to initialize and then ran only `./build_hot_reload.sh` from within neovim. I didn't realize the exit 1 was meant for the combination. ",
