        },
        "body": "Bumps [com.google.cloud:google-cloud-storage](https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage) from 2.44.1 to 2.46.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/releases\">com.google.cloud:google-cloud-storage's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v2.46.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/compare/v2.45.0...v2.46.0\">2.46.0</a> (2024-12-13)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduce <code>java.time</code> methods and variables (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2826\">#2826</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/baf30ee91febbcda7d0f64b0083b789c4384a3c0\">baf30ee</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Update retry lifecycle when attempting to decompress a gzip object (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2840\">#2840</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/7dba13cbbfd38d3c2147b25264934f33c5dc78e3\">7dba13c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Dependencies</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Update dependency com.google.apis:google-api-services-storage to v1-rev20241113-2.0.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2823\">#2823</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/503e518550b67870c3e856957fdadbc012eff1ed\">503e518</a>)</li>\n<li>Update dependency com.google.apis:google-api-services-storage to v1-rev20241206-2.0.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2839\">#2839</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/8f3cdd39dbbbbd63c560c3cb44d1032c0bd41749\">8f3cdd3</a>)</li>\n<li>Update gcr.io/cloud-devrel-public-resources/storage-testbench docker tag to v0.50.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2825\">#2825</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/9aa68a67d931b19175e23f883a109f22b99411ca\">9aa68a6</a>)</li>\n<li>Update sdk-platform-java dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2841\">#2841</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/2a704815ee60b8ec7ff2c1af557fee4366ea2e19\">2a70481</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add samples for soft delete (objects) (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2754\">#2754</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/41bc807e94f1c0eebd41b4a7baa12301858cc16f\">41bc807</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v2.45.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/compare/v2.44.1...v2.45.0\">2.45.0</a> (2024-11-18)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Adds support for restore token (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/aef367dac146147bfbbb46b64aa91a7aebe05b6c\">aef367d</a>)</li>\n<li>Adds support for restore token (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2768\">#2768</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/0394354c81b35b66d46d84b9afb090d891ee6a12\">0394354</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> Update the Java code generator (gapic-generator-java) to 2.49.0 (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/aef367dac146147bfbbb46b64aa91a7aebe05b6c\">aef367d</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> Update the Java code generator (gapic-generator-java) to 2.50.0 (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/281cccbafd2ef17c56ab4095e1f14aab2d11427e\">281cccb</a>)</li>\n<li>Set default values for monitored resource (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2809\">#2809</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/27829a48813a2cd89d4ddf78cf8f925b64388cd8\">27829a4</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Dependencies</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Update sdk-platform-java dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2817\">#2817</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/9e961c4a5058234f04bf71eb45185f5641c0b9a4\">9e961c4</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">com.google.cloud:google-cloud-storage's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/compare/v2.45.0...v2.46.0\">2.46.0</a> (2024-12-13)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduce <code>java.time</code> methods and variables (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2826\">#2826</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/baf30ee91febbcda7d0f64b0083b789c4384a3c0\">baf30ee</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Update retry lifecycle when attempting to decompress a gzip object (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2840\">#2840</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/7dba13cbbfd38d3c2147b25264934f33c5dc78e3\">7dba13c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Dependencies</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Update dependency com.google.apis:google-api-services-storage to v1-rev20241113-2.0.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2823\">#2823</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/503e518550b67870c3e856957fdadbc012eff1ed\">503e518</a>)</li>\n<li>Update dependency com.google.apis:google-api-services-storage to v1-rev20241206-2.0.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2839\">#2839</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/8f3cdd39dbbbbd63c560c3cb44d1032c0bd41749\">8f3cdd3</a>)</li>\n<li>Update gcr.io/cloud-devrel-public-resources/storage-testbench docker tag to v0.50.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/java-storage/issues/2825\">#2825</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/googleapis/java-storage/commit/9aa68a67d93